You are given two string variables a and b, and you have to print a and b with a
space between them. However, you must prevent the print statement from providing a 
new line as the new line will be given by the main driver code.
 class Solution {
    public void utility(Scanner sc) {
        // code here
        String a=sc.next();
        String b=sc.next();
        System.out.print(a+" "+b);
    }
}
